  "title": "India-Singapore Bilateral Ties Reaching New Heights",
  "summary": "The Singapore Prime Minister Lawrence Wong met a ministerial delegation led by Nirmala Sitharaman to discuss ways to deepen bilateral ties, particularly in areas like advanced manufacturing, digitalisation, and connectivity. The meeting was part of the India-Singapore Ministerial Roundtable (ISMR).",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Lawrence Wong met Nirmala Sitharaman and Indian ministers ahead of the ISMR on August 19-20.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The meeting focused on building on progress made in bilateral ties, with discussions on digitalization, manufacturing, and connectivity.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The leaders discussed how Singapore and India can expand their strategic partnership further.",
      "confidence": 0.95
